# Exact source and artifact custody requires the same working-tree bytes on
# Windows, Linux, and macOS. GitHub stores text as LF; every checkout must retain
# those bytes so content hashes and deterministic reference builds agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary publication and runtime assets are never line-ending transformed.
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
